# Route cheats_off — cheats.pad plus a pad visit that steps Slow motion OFF -> 0.5x -> 0.25x -> OFF (three Right presses on its row), for
# tools/mod_cheats_check.sh --pad-off: the car's distance per step per m/s must follow each factor and be normal again after OFF. +1800 chord opens
# the menu, +1900 Down, +2000 / +2300 / +2600 Right, +2900 the chord closes it. The throttle (held to +2950) is hidden while the menu is open.
